ceive the shares"},"returns":{"_shares":"- the amount of shares issued"}},"harvest()":{"details":"Can be called by anyone against an incentive in cvxCrv"},"increaseAllowance(address,uint256)":{"details":"Atomically increases the allowance granted to `spender` by the caller. This is an alternative to {approve} that can be used as a mitigation for problems described in {IERC20-approve}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. Requirements: - `spender` cannot be the zero address."},"name()":{"details":"Returns the name of the token."},"outstanding3CrvRewards()":{"returns":{"total":"- the total amount of 3CRV claimable"}},"outstandingCrvRewards()":{"returns":{"total":"- the total amount of CRV claimable"}},"outstandingCvxRewards()":{"returns":{"total":"- the total amount of CVX claimable"}},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby removing any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"setCallIncentive(uint256)":{"params":{"_incentive":"- the amount of the new incentive (in BIPS)"}},"setPlatform(address)":{"params":{"_platform":"- the new platform wallet address"}},"setPlatformFee(uint256)":{"params":{"_fee":"- the amount of the new platform fee (in BIPS)"}},"setWithdrawalPenalty(uint256)":{"params":{"_penalty":"- the amount of the new penalty (in BIPS)"}},"symbol()":{"details":"Returns the symbol of the token, usually a shorter version of the name."},"totalSupply()":{"details":"See {IERC20-totalSupply}."},"totalUnderlying()":{"returns":{"total":"- the total amount of tokens staked"}},"transfer(address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transfer}. Requirements: - `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - the caller must have a balance of at least `amount`."},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transferFrom}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. This is not required by the EIP. See the note at the beginning of {ERC20}. Requirements: - `sender` and `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - `sender` must have a balance of at least `amount`. - the caller must have allowance for ``sender``'s tokens of at least `amount`."},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"withdraw(address,uint256)":{"params":{"_shares":"- the number of shares sent","_to":"- address to send cvxCrv to"},"returns":{"withdrawn":"- the amount of cvxCRV returned to the user"}},"withdrawAll(address)":{"params":{"_to":"- address to send cvxCrv to"},"returns":{"withdrawn":"- the amount of cvxCRV returned to the user"}},"withdrawAllAs(address,uint8)":{"params":{"_to":"- address to send cvxCrv to","option":"- what to swap to"}},"withdrawAllAs(address,uint8,uint256)":{"params":{"_to":"- address to send cvxCrv to","minAmountOut":"- minimum desired amount of output token","option":"- what to swap to"}},"withdrawAs(address,uint256,uint8)":{"params":{"_shares":"- the number of shares sent","_to":"- address to send cvxCrv to","option":"- what to swap to"}},"withdrawAs(address,uint256,uint8,uint256)":{"params":{"_shares":"- the number of shares sent","_to":"- address to send cvxCrv to","minAmountOut":"- minimum desired amount of output token","option":"- what to swap to"}}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"balanceOfUnderlying(address)":{"notice":"Returns the amount of cvxCRV a user can claim"},"deposit(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Deposit user funds in the autocompounder and mints tokens representing user's share of the pool in exchange"},"depositAll(address)":{"notice":"Deposit all of user's cvxCRV balance"},"harvest()":{"notice":"Claim rewards and swaps them to cvxCrv for restaking"},"outstanding3CrvRewards()":{"notice":"Query the total amount of currently claimable 3CRV"},"outstandingCrvRewards()":{"notice":"Query the total amount of currently claimable CRV"},"outstandingCvxRewards()":{"notice":"Query the total amount of currently claimable CVX"},"setApprovals()":{"notice":"Set approvals for the contracts used when swapping & staking"},"setCallIncentive(uint256)":{"notice":"Updates the caller incentive for harvests"},"setPlatform(address)":{"notice":"Updates the address to which platform fees are paid out"},"setPlatformFee(uint256)":{"notice":"Updates the part of yield redirected to the platform"},"setWithdrawalPenalty(uint256)":{"notice":"Updates the withdrawal penalty"},"totalUnderlying()":{"notice":"Query the amount currently staked"},"underlying()":{"notice":"Returns the address of the underlying token"},"withdraw(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Unstake cvxCrv in proportion to the amount of shares sent"},"withdrawAll(address)":{"notice":"Withdraw all of a users' position as cvxCRV"},"withdrawAllAs(address,uint8)":{"notice":"Zap function to withdraw all shares to another token"},"withdrawAllAs(address,uint8,uint256)":{"notice":"Zap function to withdraw all shares to another token"},"withdrawAs(address,uint256,uint8)":{"notice":"Zap function to withdraw as another token"},"withdrawAs(address,uint256,uint8,uint256)":{"notice":"Zap function to withdraw as another token"}},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"UnionVault.sol":"UnionVault"},"evmVersion":"london","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"UnionVault.sol":{"keccak256":"0xa3a77e6b5d8ac0d50586ba3d7d7f7c4d03dbd5831ae96cf5a447bd2c413052d7","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://981fdcb28b23c1b69fbb1ba2652aa73e003a9c9b7a12a5ea73fa6f3fcb50750a","dweb:/ipfs/QmUvXKF56xUeUKQcNqcLgixnSRCJHU5aYa1xyDT9UeJPpj"]}},"version":1}